      "id": "why-it-matters",
      "title": "Why it matters",
      "body": "Hotel staff usually need one concrete detail: your booking, room number, time, or the item you need. For \"I have a reservation\", Tôi có đặt phòng helps by putting the booking first so staff can look it up before you explain more. Keep the booking name, code, room number, or ticket visible until staff find the record.",
      "presentation": "plain-text"
    },
